Usage: hops skills [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...

  Discover the Hopsworks skills (Markdown playbooks) available to agents.

Options:
  --json                  Output as JSON (machine-readable; for LLMs and
                          scripts).
  -q, --quiet             Suppress success/info/warn lines; print only data +
                          errors.
  --verify / --no-verify  Verify the Hopsworks TLS certificate; --no-verify
                          skips verification for self-signed / IP-SAN-
                          mismatched certs.
  -h, --help              Show this message and exit.

Commands:
  list  List available skills as a table (or JSON with ``--json``).
  show  Print a skill's ``SKILL.md`` so an agent can load it.
